    "description": "<font color=\"#b6a4ff\">The alien Llama is coming for our earth!</font>\r\n\r\nUnleash the beast within! In Mutant Llama, you'll breed and raise unique mutant llamas with powerful abilities. Train them to perfection, evolve their skills, and dominate the arena in epic battles!\r\n\r\n<font color=\"#b6a4ff\">Game Features:</font>\r\n- Breed and collect an endless variety of mutant llamas\r\n- Train and evolve their unique skills\r\n- Unleash incredible abilities in the arena\r\n- Challenge other players and climb the leaderboards\r\n\r\nDo you have what it takes to create the ultimate mutant llama champion? Download Mutant Llama for free now!\r\n\r\nOfficial Discord Server:\r\nhttps://discord.com/invite/neNumNed5v\r\n\r\nOfficial Facebook Page:\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/gaming/mutant.llama.game",
